Antalia-2 Mini
Copyright PatientDesk AI and the Antalia contributors

The bundled ONNX weights and frontend data are the Antalia-2 Mini release.
Upstream states that the code, text normaliser, and weights are Apache-2.0,
and that the voice is synthetic rather than a recording of a real person.

Source: https://huggingface.co/cloud0day3/antalia-mini
License: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Vesta Dub bundles these files for local inference. It does not download a
replacement copy at runtime.
